    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for the heads up. i'll shut it off right now. i'm just a bit creeped out because it's not just a random scratching—it sounds almost deliberate, like it's testing something. and honestly, the way it darted away... it didn't feel like a mouse. it was too fast and too small-looking. \n\nif it is a pest, how do i even get it out? i don't want to just reach in there and get bitten or something. is there a way to flush it out or trap it without having to rip the whole machine apart? i'm really hoping it's just a big bug and not something more... troublesome.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
